"type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_13","text":"So, if we're being realistic, we have two choices.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_14","text":"First. Return to the Central Government and cooperate with the investigation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_15","text":"I'll be there to make sure they don't treat you roughly like before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_16","text":"We'll prove to them that you're completely and utterly free of corruption, and explain the mechanisms behind it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_17","text":"While on paper, this is the safest and most conventional method,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_18","text":"but it might not even be possible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_19","text":"Especially considering I'm essentially a wanted criminal.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_20","text":"I doubt I'll even be given the chance to explain myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_21","text":"Now, the second choice. Hide out and wait.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_22","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_23","text":"Like I told you, humanity has acknowledged defeat and is hiding underground.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_24","text":"An operation called Ark Guardian, centered around the Goddess Squad, is underway.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_25","text":"Whatever form it ends up assuming, the operation will soon come to a close.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_26","text":"The people will seal the Ark and ensure that nothing can enter or exit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_27","text":"Our second option is to hide away and wait until that happens.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_28","text":"What happens then?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_29","text":"I dunno. Maybe consider getting into farming?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_30","text":"What's the point of living on a planet where nothing remains?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_31","text":"You'll be alive, and that will be significant enough.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_32","text":"You will wait. And you'll keep waiting.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_33","text":"When humanity eventually emerges from their underground city,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_34","text":"that is when you will help them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_35","text":"After enough time has passed, they'll be willing to overlook much of what has happened.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_36","text":"While it's a safe choice,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"abe","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_37","text":"the disadvantage is that it will take a lot of time, and there's always the off chance that it will backfire.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_oldtales2_05_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_oldtales2_05_s_38","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgAr